 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "man: one, you",
     "texto": [
      "**Man** is an impersonal pronoun used with the verb in the third person singular: **Hier darf man nicht rauchen** (smoking isn't allowed here). It can also take a reflexive pronoun: **Man muss sich anmelden** (you have to register), **Man wäscht sich** (you wash yourself)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "jemand, niemand, einer, keiner",
     "texto": [
      "**Jemand** = someone; **niemand** = nobody; **einer / keiner** = one / none of a group. In the nominative they usually take a singular verb: **Niemand weiß es**. They change form according to the case: **Ich sehe jemanden** (I see someone), **Ich helfe jemandem** (I help someone). For **einer/keiner** the ending also changes: **Einer kommt**, **Ich sehe einen**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
